      "name": "32 · AI 工作台 / 方案待确认",
      "context": "Variation 32 · selective apply. Inspiration dissected from existing product knowledge, no browsing: Git staging provides group-level inclusion and an explicit commit boundary; Lightroom separates non-destructive previews from originals. The design turns those principles into two selectable edit groups, a preview banner, draft-only prompting, and a single atomic Apply action. Same Soft Canvas colors, typography, corner treatments and spacing as the prior variations. Verification: drawer and whole screen screenshots reviewed; content fits; no clipped drawer nodes; sufficient contrast; aligned rows and persistent bottom controls. Previous variants preserved.",
